¿13 Iouliou 2015. Ustera apo 17 ores skleres diapragmateuses, o Alexes Tsipras exerkhetai tes sunodou ton Europaion egeton tsalakomenos kai kourasmenos, gia na anakoinosei sto Panellenio oti kataphere na apotrepsei ten exodo tes khoras apo to euro. O idios o prothupourgos paradekhtheke argotera oti, kata te diarkeia tou protou examenou tou 2015, eginan diapragmateutika lathe kai anaphertheke se "autapates". To pathema, omos, den mporei na ginei mathema oute gia tous kubernontes oute gia te khora dikhos te sundrome sobares epistemonikes analuses. Oi epistemes ton oikonomikon kai tes koinonikes psukhologias mporoun na mas exegesoun arketa apla poia einai auta ta lathe kai na mas didaxoun pos prepei na ginontai oi diapragmateuseis toso ston khoro tes politikes oso kai sten kathemerinoteta mas.
