É"To kitrino skuli" einai ena keimeno epeigousas glossikes pragmatikotetas.
O suggrapheas, me aphorme ten epithese me bitrioli, ton perasmeno Dekembrio, kata tes Boulgaras katharistrias Konstantinas Kouneba, egrapse ton makru, puretiko monologo mias neas gunaikas.
E Rouska Rouseba anapneei mesa apo phones pou katalambanoun ten kathemerinoteta tes* prosopa oikeia, tukhaia, uperbatika te metamorphonoun s' ena poluphoniko paramileto. Auto einai ena aphegematiko paradoxo. E eroida tou Phais diekdikei enan kosmo agapes, tautokhrona, mesa apo ten politike tou anuperaspistou eautou kai te metaphusike tou me peraitero eautou. Auto einai ena ethiko paradoxo.
"To kitrino skuli" pianei to nema tou monologou "Koimosoun..." ("Autobiographia enos bibliou", 1994), tou diegematos "Thammene (zontane) istoria" ("Ap' to idio poteri", 1999), tou aphegematos "Aegypius monachus" (2001) kai tou photographikou bibliou "E pole sta gonata" (2002).
Prokeitai gia ena peridinoumeno keimeno, opou o realismos tes epithumias khoneuei motiba tes eterotetas, tou apodiopompaiou thumatos kai tou apomageumenou kosmou."×
ÔPantou nekroi kai ptomata. Oles tis ores kai oles tis meres. Brephe kai dialumena gerontia, epheboi kai aneggikhtes thugateres pephtoun xepnooi san na katrakuloun athoruba apo ton ourano. Tous sekonoun aron aron kai tous traboun sta nekrotomeia, tous bazoun sta athlia surtaria tou psuktikou nekrothalamou, gia na tous phutepsoun ten alle mera ste nekroupole tes enorias tous. Mellontikos nekros o kathenas mas, kuklophorei anamesa se torinous kai aboethetous nekrous."Ù
ÖO,ti thumamai einai ena palimpsesto apo Kathares Deuteres. Misoteleiomena geumata, lekiasmena trapezomantila, akroteriasmoi mikres klimakas.
Gennethekame Augousto. Selene dekatessaron emeron. O aderphos mou ki ego."Ù
ÖS' auto edo to muthistorema, phainomenika (kai se prote anagnose), asundeta metaxu tous kephalaia briskoun te sunokhe tous kai ten alleloukhia tous -oso prokhora e anagnose- kai me te bathmiaia sundese gegonoton kai prosopon (auto pou leme "muthistorema"), alla kai me te boetheia tou philosophikou stokhasmou pou prosdiorizei, epikathorizei, diaperna kai entelei, uperbainei ta kathara muthistorematika stoikheia.
Uparkhoun ligo polu ta panta ste sugkrotese autou tou bibliou: Muthistoria, philosophikos stokhasmos (apo te metaphusike mekhri ton uparxismo, pernontas apo orismenes marxistikes apopseis), istorikes kai politikes anaphores, psukhologikes analuseis, autobiographika stoikheia tou suggraphea, khroniko, k.a., etsi pou na men einai anantistoikhe aute e sugkrotese pros to kharakterismo pou dinei o idios o Ernesto Sampato s' auto edo to ergo tou: "Oliko muthistorema" ("Novela total").
Ena kurio kharakteristiko tou "Abaddon o exolothreutes" einai oti o idios o suggrapheas einai o "protagonistes" mesa sto ergo tou, ekhontas to rolo tou Aggelou tes arkhaias ellenikes tragodias, eite milontas sto proto e to trito prosopo gia ton eauto tou, eite tautizomenos (kapote, en merei e, spania kai pros stigme oloklerotika - omos auto, as to anakalupsei o anagnostes) me orismena apo ta prosopa tou muthistorematos. Eukola tha mporouse na apophanthei kaneis oti ekhoume na kanoume me mia morphe muthistorematikes "pneumatikes autobiographias".
(apo ten eisagoge tou Manole Papadolampake)"Û	
Ø	Ta megala taxidia kai oi megales diadromes sumbainoun kamia phora mesa se liga tetragonika metra. To mualo dianuei apostaseis treles ten ora pou ta podia menoun karphomena sto patoma. Oi anthropoi ton megalon dromon paleuoun me te monaxia tous, epoulonoun tis pleges tous, skotonoun to parelthon mekhri pou auto xanarkhetai kai tous khtupa ten porta. Agrieuoun kai emereuoun opos ta skulia, analoga me tis orexeis tous, ermaia tou kharaktera tous, autes tes abussou pou den ten epelexan, den apophasizoun gia tipota, antidroun mono ston sunagermo tou egkephalou, otan autos energopoieitai kai bouizei mesa st' autia tous. Anthropophagoi kai thumata, suggeneis ex aimatos, ergazontai kai droun sten Ellada, misoun kai agapoun to idio banausa, stekontai orthioi e gonatizoun sta tessera me ten idia phusikoteta. Ki otan o erotas apophasizei na drasei, ginetai phoniko oplo. To takhudromeio tes geitonias, to kommoterio tou khoriou, o tetartos orophos mias tukhaias polukatoikias, ta mprizolakia tou Tele, mia muga pou kopanietai sto tzami, to arni tou Paskha, ta makaronia me kima. To gourlomeno mati tou arniou ligo prin apo te sphage, to gourlomeno mati tou anthropou te stigme tes egkataleipses, o megalos dromos tes zoes pros ton thanato."Ş

Û
Perfect for fans of Laura Childs, Ellery Adams, and Jenn McKinlay, Marty Wingate's enchanting Potting Shed Mystery series heads to Scotland as Pru Parke plans her wedding . . . all while a vengeful murderer is poised to strike again. 
After her romantic idyll with the debonair Detective Chief Inspector Christopher Pearse culminates in a marriage proposal, Pru Parke sets about arranging their nuptials while diving into a short-term gig at the Royal Botanic Garden Edinburgh. At hand is the authentication of a journal purportedly penned by eighteenth-century botanist and explorer Archibald Menzies. Compared to the chaos of wedding planning, studying the journal is an agreeable task . . . that is, until a search for a missing cat leads to the discovery of a dead body: One of Pru's colleagues has been conked on the head with a rock and dumped from a bridge into the Water of Leith.
Pru can't help wondering if the murder has something to do with the Menzies diary. Is the killer covering up a forgery? Among the police's many suspects are a fallen aristocrat turned furniture maker, Pru's overly solicitous assistant, even Pru herself. Now, in the midst of sheer torture by the likes of flamboyant wedding dress designers and eccentric church organists, Pru must also uncover the work of a sly murderer--unless this bride wants to walk down the aisle in handcuffs."â
ßS' auto to bibliaraki diaskeuasa merika paramuthia pou sugkentrosan o megalos tourkos laographos Mporotab kai oi mathetes tou. Theoresa aparaitete aute te diaskeue, dioti nomizo oti m' auto ton tropo dinoun mia pio soste apantese sta problemata tou kairou mas. Khoris na mimoumai ten tekhnike graphe ton paramuthion, alla epopheloumenos ap' aute, epikheiresa na grapso ki ego merika. Den xero bebaia an tha sas aresoun, sigoura omos tha sas eukharistesoun ekeina pou mazepse o Mporotab. Omos ta paramuthia einai protimotero na t' akous para na ta diabazeis. As arkhisoume loipon: Mia phora kai enan kairo..."æ
ãBriskouaste sto 1918 kai e Europe bgainei ue duskolia apo ton ephialte tou A Pagkosuiou poleuou: uia sugkrouse pou sphragisteke apo tis uakhes ton kharakouaton, opou pano apo ennea ekatouuuria stratiotes ekhasan te zoe tous kai eikosi ekatouuuria peripou trauuatistekan. O Geruanoebraios Otto Phrank einai anauesa stous ligous tukherous pou epistrephoun sooi kai ablabeis sten patrida tous. Mia Geruania baria trauuatisuene apo te phrike pou ekhei uolis biosei, aphoreta piesuene apo to baros ton poleuikon apozeuioseon pou prepei na plerosei. H zoe ouos einai phtiaguene gia na sunekhizetai ki eno e pagkosuia politike taxe upainei se nees baseis, opos oristekan apo ton poleuo, ekatouuuria anthropoi arkhizoun pali na zoun, prospathontas, uera ue te uera, na sbesoun tis anauneseis tes bias: to idio kanei kai o upolokhagos Phrank kai e suzugos tou Entith, oi opoioi to 1925 einai ena nearo eroteuueno zeugari, pou blepei ten eutukhia tou na koruphonetai ue te gennese duo uperokhon koritsion. Mesa sten asphaleia tes oikogeneias Phrank, e glukia, esukhe Margko kai e uikrotere kai pio zoere Anna pernoun galenia paidika khronia, parolo pou ta tertipia tes pagkosuias istorias kai oi sunepeies tes ethnikes politikes duskherainoun kathe uera olo kai perissotero te zoe olon. E Anna einai uia aneuele paidoula trion khronon otan to Ethnikososialistiko Kouua kerdizei gia ta kala edaphos sto geruaniko koinoboulio kai tessaron khronon uolis otan o Adolphos Khitler khrizetai kagkelarios. Akoue den uporei na diablepsei ton neo ephialte pou tha zesei e idia kai ekatouuuria alloi Ebraioi: ton ephialte uias khauenes zoes, uias axioprepeias pou kouuatiazetai kai podopateitai, ton ateleioto trouo exaitias tes anthropines agriotetas, pou e Anna, ephebe ede ki anagkasuene na krubetai apo tous nazistes se ena uustiko kataphugio, perigraphei, uera ue te uera, sto peripheuo euerologio pou tha ten kanei argotera diaseue, oso kai o Shoah, ena exairetika dunato prosopo-suubolo.
To biblio kleinei ue te uarturia tou uonadikou epizonta, tou patera tes Annas, anaphorika ue ten anakalupse kai deuosieuse tou euerologiou.
<>. Siegmund Ginzberg, Repubblica"ç
äFrom the #1 New York Timesbestselling author comes an explosive new thriller
She had the perfect life.
She had the perfect cover.
She was the perfect witness.
Until they found her.
From the blockbuster bestselling author of the Eve Duncan novels comes a new, stand alone thriller about a woman with a photographic memory who has lived her life in the Witness Protection Program. What she once saw put her entire family in jeopardy and now, years later, her cover is blown. She's on the run, and the lives of those she holds dear hang in the balance. As only Iris Johansen can do, you won't see the twists coming."í	
ê	In the second volume of her Hannah trilogy, summer has arrived, and fourteen-year-old Hannah Anderson is excited about spending it with Max (who has been giving her stomach butterflies lately). But things are happening in Cowichan Bay that Hannah can't explain. When a mysterious accident leads her to a nest of starving eaglets, she meets Izzy Tate, a young Metis girl staying in the village for the summer. Why is Izzy so angry all the time, and is it just a coincidence that she is the spitting image of Yisella, the Cowichan girl Hannah met the summer she was twelve? But Hannah has more questions. Why is Jack, her supernatural raven friend, bringing her unusual "gifts" in the middle of the night? Is it all connected to a ring of poachers and marijuana smugglers who have apparently moved into the valley. Hannah and Izzy fear that the eaglets are in danger. And what's with the Orca 1, the "supposedly" abandoned tuna boat anchored out in the bay? After Hannah and Max make a grisly discovery in the woods, they know they must take action. When Izzy agrees to join them on a midnight kayak trip, the three discover great danger on the Orca 1, and they are soon in a fight for their own lives and the lives of the animals being hunted for their parts."	
